<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - UCAR raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UCAR raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns raised its rating on the shares of UCAR Inc to buy from attractive, a source at the brokerage firm said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- UCAR stock closed at 46-3/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
